OL,3,ABurnham vows end to 'rip-off parking
OL,4,Acharges' under new rules
OL,5,
OL,6,FPrivate car parks already have an
OL,7,Findustry code of practice, but the RAC
OL,8,Fmotoring group said the government's
OL,9,Fchanges would protect drivers from the
OL,10,F"poor practices of some private parking
OL,11,Fcompanies".
